OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIsolated
OL,6,Fshowers focused north of Lough Neagh,
OL,7,Fturning wintry to low levels. Most in
OL,8,Fsouth dry with clear spells and light
OL,9,Fwinds bringing a frost to many come
OL,10,Fdawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCold. Frosty start for many.
OL,13,FSunny spells. Most dry but showers in
OL,14,Ffar north during the morning. Higher
OL,15,Fcloud feeding from south for afternoon.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,18,FThrough to mid-Thursday staying rather
OL,19,Fcloudy with showers or longer periods
OL,20,Fof rain. Turning dry and bright later
OL,21,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
